# Fathom local state: the content-addressed store, the lineage ledger, and per-run report
# files. These are regenerable from the committed code and manifests by construction, so they
# are not tracked. No binary corpus data is ever committed; the acceptance corpus is generated
# at run time from a seed.
/.fathom/

